  "findings": [
    "In-memory per-process notification reservation TTL keyed fingerprint/chat/thread/status, not file content. Mutex atomically reserves; Forget intended on delivery failure. TTL compares <= boundary, Sweep expires strictly>; no size cap, process restart resets. Fingerprint/status caller supplied, key plain separator strings no escaping; expected status/FP domain still requires source review.",
    "Nine original top-level Go tests source-read including4Key subcases and100goroutine one-winner test; zero executed, Go absent PATH. Covers reserve expiry/forget/sweep/nil/empty/cancel. No reservation generation token, so stale Forget could remove newer reservation after TTL rollover; source-only concurrency concern unexecuted.",
    "Handler explicitly accounts deadline unattempted remainder as207; returns attempts/errors counts, no failed-ID list. On multipart send any successful part retains entire target reservation, even later parts fail; retry suppresses missing parts for TTL intentionally prioritizing no duplicate prefix. Current per-target delivered-parts completeness tradeoff cannot transfer to exact file grouping. No Telegram/HTTP/server operation invoked.",
    "Five source/contract modules read fully. Alertmanager fingerprint/status forwarded directly; absent fingerprint disables cache via empty key, no fallback hash. Generic fallback hash includes title/raw body/status/sortedlabels but not severity/annotations/links/timestamp; final body trimmed after raw body hashing, so semantic equal whitespace bodies may have different fingerprints. Generic batch rejects whole payload on one invalid event rather than returning partial list.",
    "Kubewatch hash includes kind/namespace/name/reason/type/normalized body, excludes timestamp: repeat samecontent event withinTTL suppressed intentionally. Shared fingerprint SHA256 first16bytes with NUL separators; no NUL escaping/length prefix, potential structural ambiguity if string inputs containNUL, source-only observation not executed Go. Generic labels serialize key=val without escaping equals, needs schema qualification.",
    "Cache Key does not include source. Generic accepts explicit fingerprint/status so cross-source samefingerprint/status/target may suppress each other depending whether caller shares cache; main/server wiring still pending. Distinguish semantic notification identity from exact file identity;128bit digest alone not byte equality. No network, Telegram or original Go tests executed."
  ],
